      en: ["The town was occupied by Britain in 1848 and named Greytown.", "It is located at the Caribbean mouth of the San Juan River.", "It receives the highest annual rainfall in Nicaragua, exceeding 5000 mm.", "It was a major transit hub for the California Gold Rush in 1849.", "The U.S. Navy bombarded and burned the city to the ground in 1854.", "San Juan del Norte is a world-class destination for tarpon fishing."],
