      en: ["San Ramón was officially granted municipality status on August 31, 1905.", "The town is located just 12 kilometers from the city of Matagalpa.", "The region was historically a major center for gold mining in Nicaragua.", "The average elevation of the town is 640 meters above sea level.", "It is home to a significant population of indigenous Matagalpa people.", "The \"La Reina\" mine was once one of the most productive gold mines in the area."],
