      en: ["The municipality of El Tortuguero was officially created on March 13, 1996.", "The total administrative area spans approximately 2,271 square kilometers.", "The Curinhuás River is the essential lifeline for local transport and trade.", "The majority of the population consists of mestizo internal migrants.", "Agriculture in the area primarily focuses on corn, beans, and rice production.", "The town serves as a key inland port for the South Caribbean region."],
